1. `OK INTEG DECOMPOSE - Разбиваю план по UI-элементам (batch)`
1a. Прочитай **Gates**
2. Source: `integration/plan/plan-<task_id>.md` — Element registry + **Replacement / sunset** + mocks
3. Папка `integration/plan/decompose-<plan_id>/`: index + все eNN  
   Шаблоны: @.cursor/templates/decompose/index.md + @.cursor/templates/decompose/index.yaml + @.cursor/templates/decompose/epic-step.yaml
   **Schema HARD:** каждый `eNN` = `epic-decompose/v1` + `role: integ`; **FORBIDDEN** invented schemas; FINISH `validate-decompose-tree` fail-closed.
   `index.yaml` обязателен: `schema: epic-decompose-index/v1`, корень `steps:`, каждый `eNN` содержит минимум `id`, `file`, `title`, `next_phase`, `status`. Формат roadmap `queue:` для decompose запрещён.  
   Шаг: §UI · §Data · §API today · **§Contract lean** · §BACK/FRONT/DB · `deletes` · §0.11 · §Verify
3a. Index: Requirements / Stages / Outcome map / **Replacement cleanup**
3b. **FAIL** если mock/legacy replace в plan без eNN с `deletes` (и без out_of_scope+follow-up **в queue**)
